+	// ===== Stratum start: AVX2 decode v2 =====
+	// 1) uniform-words fast path (word where every plane is 0 or -1 => 32 identical blocks);
+	// 2) mixed-words: butterfly-transpose 8x8 bits (HD-style) instead of chain of vpsrlvd/vpand/vpslld/vpor;
+	// 3) palette lookup via vpgatherdd with mask;
+	// 4) word loading and classification (uniform/mixed) — one pass, loop unrolled x2.
